    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but the tiny moments are just more of nothing. i'm just waiting for time to pass, and even that feels like a chore. it's like i'm a book that's already had its final chapter written, and i'm just staring at the blank pages that come after. i don't want to navigate a void. i just want the void to be over. it feels like there's no way back to being a real person, just this empty shell.",
